 err←toArrowSchema args;arrow_opts;types;names;col_count;out_schema
⍝ Low-level wrapper for duckdb_to_arrow_schema
⍝ args: (arrow_opts types names col_count out_schema_ptr)
⍝   arrow_opts: duckdb_arrow_options pointer
⍝   types: vector of duckdb_logical_type pointers
⍝   names: vector of C-string pointers (char **)
⍝   col_count: number of columns
⍝   out_schema_ptr: pointer to ArrowSchema struct memory
⍝ err: duckdb_error_data pointer (destroy with destroyErrorData)

 (arrow_opts types names col_count out_schema)←args
 err←api.duckdb_to_arrow_schema arrow_opts types names col_count out_schema

